<title>GREECE: Hellenic Invest posts 96 results.</title>
<headline>Hellenic Invest posts 96 results.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year results to December 31</p>
<p>			(in million drachmas unless stated)</p>
<p> Gross investment income   4,107	   vs    3,766</p>
<p> Net			     3,422	   vs    3,263</p>
<p> Dividend			2,812	   vs    3,037</p>
<p> Dividend per share	    250  dr     vs	270  dr</p>
<p> Net asset value per share 2,349  dr  Discount			  2.5%</p>
<p>Note: Hellenic Investments is a closed-end fund. NAV per share in January 31.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
